72 769.89 Td (Hospital Policy Handbook) Tj
72 735.09 Td (This document contains hospital rules and policies for patients and visitors. It) Tj
72 720.09 Td (is intended as a sample document for a Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\)) Tj
72 705.09 Td (project.) Tj
72 675.09 Td (1. Appointment Cancellation Policy) Tj
72 652.59 Td (Patients should cancel appointments at least 24 hours before the scheduled time.) Tj
72 637.59 Td (Repeated missed appointments may require rebooking based on availability.) Tj
72 607.59 Td (2. Patient Registration) Tj
72 585.09 Td (All patients must provide valid identification during registration. Existing) Tj
72 570.09 Td (patients should present their patient ID or previous visit information whenever) Tj
72 555.09 Td (possible.) Tj
72 525.09 Td (3. Visitor Policy) Tj
72 502.59 Td (Only two visitors are permitted per patient at one time. Visitors must follow) Tj
72 487.59 Td (staff instructions and maintain a quiet environment.) Tj
72 457.59 Td (4. Infection Prevention) Tj
72 435.09 Td (Hand sanitization is required before entering patient rooms. Masks may be) Tj
72 420.09 Td (mandatory in designated wards depending on hospital policy.) Tj
72 390.09 Td (5. Billing and Payments) Tj
72 367.59 Td (Hospital bills should be settled before discharge unless covered by an approved) Tj
72 352.59 Td (insurance provider. Receipts are issued for all completed payments.) Tj
72 322.59 Td (6. Prescription Medicines) Tj
72 300.09 Td (Prescription medications are dispensed only upon presentation of a valid) Tj
72 285.09 Td (prescription issued by a licensed physician.) Tj
72 255.09 Td (7. Medical Records Request) Tj
72 232.59 Td (Patients can request copies of their medical records by submitting a written) Tj
72 217.59 Td (request. Processing typically takes three to five business days.) Tj
72 187.59 Td (8. Patient Responsibilities) Tj
72 165.09 Td (Patients should provide accurate medical information, follow prescribed) Tj
72 150.09 Td (treatments, respect hospital staff, and attend follow-up appointments.) Tj
72 120.09 Td (9. Privacy and Confidentiality) Tj
72 97.59 Td (Patient information is treated as confidential and is shared only with authorized) Tj
72 82.59 Td (healthcare professionals or as required by law.) Tj
72 52.59 Td (10. Discharge Policy) Tj
72 30.09 Td (Patients receive discharge instructions, prescribed medications, and follow-up) Tj
72 15.09 Td (recommendations before leaving the hospital.) Tj
72 -14.91 Td (11. Complaint Procedure) Tj
72 -37.41 Td (Patients may submit complaints or feedback through the Patient Relations Office.) Tj
72 -52.41 Td (Every complaint is reviewed and responded to according to hospital policy.) Tj
